    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 46d012c7dbca0e2341d8350ba97c6dbdabd6951d -->\n**Verdict: no blocker found by reading; the build is not proven green (runner clippy step red on code this PR does not touch). Needs a maintainer look.**\n\n**What looks good**\n- `hole_digest` snaps with `cl::lattice` (1e-6), the same snap `HoleDto` / `CrossHoleDto` apply at save, so it only merges values the file would also merge. Holes 0.5 um or more apart still hash apart; non-finite values pass through, no unwrap/expect/panic. The radial `dir` stays verbatim, as the file stores it.\n- On-lattice holes keep their old bytes (relies on `lattice` being idempotent in f64); a file stamped before the fix from an off-lattice hole reads Stale once, which the PR body states.\n- Diff touches only `operation/{hole_digest,mod,params}.rs`, `bore_core.rs`, `bore_entry.rs` and the decision file: no Cargo/build.rs/.github/scripts/xtask, no format bump, no golden or snapshot change. Decision file present.\n\n**Results (self-hosted runner, trial merge with main): https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/43551176110**\n- Quick gate: green, \"wall 12.4 min, 2 step(s), 0 failed\" (app lib + the gate-mapped app suites incl. bore_core, bore_entry, project_roundtrip, float_roundtrip, face_holes; ui suites).\n- Clippy on the touched crates: FAILED, only in `camcraft-geometry`: `needless_range_loop` (\"the loop variable `slot` is only used to index `e.facets`\") at `crates/geometry/src/geometry/feature.rs` 481, 1205, 1486 (runner clippy 1.100). That is issue 1624. The PR does not touch `crates/geometry`. Because the geometry build stopped, clippy never reached `camcraft-app`, so the new code is not clippy-checked by the runner (the author reports clippy clean on app).\n- Not run here: Windows, batch and release tiers, GUI hole table.\n\n**Requested before merge**\n- None from the diff.\n\n**Notes (not blocking)**\n- A maintainer should decide whether to accept the red clippy step as the known 1624 runner issue, or run `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` once, since the runner could not.\n- This head already has a collaborator review (mkinney) reading ready; this independent build adds the runner result above.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
